cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the article."
title: "stroke-drg-chile: machine learning characterisation of stroke in Chile from Diagnosis-Related Group records"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible pipeline for the characterisation of clinical, demographic,
  hospital and territorial features of stroke records in the Chilean public
  hospital network, 2019-2024, using Diagnosis-Related Group discharge data.
  Feature screening by chi-square test, consensus feature selection across a
  Lasso-penalised logistic model, Random Forest and K-nearest neighbours over
  balanced resamples, model comparison by hypervolume, and interpretation with
  exact SHAP values of the final linear model.
type: software
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-07-30"

authors:
  - family-names: "Guzmán-Madriaga"
    given-names: "Ivania Elena"
    affiliation: "Departamento de Ingeniería Informática, Universidad de Santiago de Chile"
